  "type": "MULTIPLE_CHOICE",
  "data": {
    "body": "Choose the right formulas to compute the volume of the solid obtained from rotating about the line $x = 3$ the region given below, using\n(i) Washer method,\n(ii) Shell method.\nThe region is bounded by \n$y = \u2212x^2 + 4$, $x = 2$ and $y = 4$.",
    "solution": [
      0
    ],
    "answerChoices": [
      {
        "id": "015549b0-be96-4282-8acd-267b75a4e3cd",
        "index": 0,
        "body": "$\\text{(i)} \\int_0^4 \\pi\\left\\{(3-\\sqrt{4-y})^2 - 1^2\\right\\}dy, \\quad \\text{(ii)} \\int_0^2 2\\pi(3-x)\\left\\{4-(-x^2+4)\\right\\}dx$",
        "questionId": "ad0f93ad-66de-42c3-9a10-b439d887addb",
        "stats": {
