        "body": "$\\text{(i)} \\int_0^4 \\pi\\left(5-\\sqrt{4-y}\\right)^2 dy, \\quad \\text{(ii)} \\int_0^2 2\\pi x(-x^2+4)\\,dx$",
        "questionId": "ad0f93ad-66de-42c3-9a10-b439d887addb",
